Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.03,0:00:47.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《极限特工》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.66,0:02:04.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他偷走晶片 躲进去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He stole the chip, he's inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.96,0:02:08.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.25,0:02:32.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿奇!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirill!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.29,0:02:35.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该干活了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.60,0:03:55.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(国安局情报中心 维特山 维吉尼亚州)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.99,0:04:20.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,0点30分时 任务宣告失败\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At 0030 hours, the mission deviated from the set parameters.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.09,0:04:24.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,探员被杀并不在计划之内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't part of the plan for our agent to get shot in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.24,0:04:31.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身分确认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Identity confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.94,0:04:35.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麦格遇害时传送了一些资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}McGrath was uploading some data to us when he was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.57,0:04:38.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看看 我不确定这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a look at this. I'm not sure yet exactly what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.78,0:04:45.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 一个合成分子的部份 - 吉本斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A fragment of a complex molecule. - Gibbons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.78,0:04:48.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们认为它跟前苏联生化武器...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We think it's a link to a Soviet bio-weapon...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.09,0:04:50.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"寂静之夜"有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...called Silent Night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.02,0:04:54.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 詹姆士 他怎么来了? - 我找他来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- James, what the hell is he doing here? - I called him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.29,0:04:57.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经损失三名探员 他帮得上忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've lost three agents already. You could use the help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.33,0:05:00.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狙杀探员的是"无政府99"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found out your agents were killed by this group, Anarchy 99.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.77,0:05:05.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们原是军人 能轻易辨识出训练有素的探员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're ex-military. They can smell the training on our agents a mile away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.37,0:05:09.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我们该试试新方法了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, I think it's time we tried something new.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.32,0:05:21.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些不是我们的人 他们是谁? 中情局的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These guys aren't ours. Who are they? ClA?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.39,0:05:25.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 是平民百姓 是罪犯 雇兵 杀手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, civilians. Convicts, mercs, contract killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.82,0:05:28.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社会底层最机灵也最强的份子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The best and brightest of the bottom of the barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.26,0:05:32.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们根本是人渣 - 他们好用 能牺牲又肯出力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They're the scum of the earth. - Programmable, expendable, effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.40,0:05:35.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想这是最好的办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's our best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.73,0:05:38.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与其送羊入虎口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do we want to drop another mouse in the snake pit?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.04,0:05:42.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不如放只毒蛇去偷袭他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or send our own snake and let him crawl in?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.71,0:05:45.71,Default,NTP,0,0,10,,(乡村俱乐部 非会员勿入)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.21,0:05:49.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(沙加缅度 加州)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.65,0:05:53.11,Default,NTP,0,0,10,,(玩滑板是犯罪)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.29,0:05:55.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 小弟 真是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Pepe. This is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.69,0:05:58.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.59,0:06:01.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动作快点 听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's about time. Now, listen....
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.46,0:06:04.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是哪里人? 墨西哥? 我没有恶意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were you coming from Tijuana? I don't mean to be rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.83,0:06:07.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别停在太阳底下 烤漆会褪色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep it out of the sun. I don't want the paint to fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.83,0:06:11.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听得懂英文吧? 拿去 这够你花了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you understand English? I pay enough for you people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.51,0:06:18.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 珍娜 你会喜欢这里的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Janelle. You're gonna love this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.61,0:06:22.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 迪克 你好 - 这是珍娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dick, how are you? - This is Janelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.69,0:06:33.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快报警 - 开我车的人是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Call 911. - Who's driving my car?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.26,0:06:42.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是霍议员 加州州议员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Senator Hotchkiss! California state Senate!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.37,0:06:44.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 刚刚有人偷了我的车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, somebody just stole my car!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.20,0:07:13.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,红色敞篷车 立刻靠边停车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, in the red Corvette! Pull over immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.23,0:07:17.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊...条子追我 因为我偷了这车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, yeah. These monkeys are following me because I took this car.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.97,0:07:20.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这车不是我的 它太花俏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obviously the car doesn't belong to me, it's not my style.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.01,0:07:26.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它是迪克的车 霍迪克 加州州议员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It belongs to Dick, Dick Hotchkiss, a California state senator.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.51,0:07:29.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是他提案禁止饶舌歌曲...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You remember Dick. He tried to ban rap music...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.62,0:07:32.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他觉得饶舌歌鼓吹暴力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...because he feels the lyrics promote violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.89,0:07:34.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是音乐 迪克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's music, Dick!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.62,0:07:39.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他也想提案禁止电玩...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He also wants to pull every video game off every shelf in the country...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.29,0:07:45.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他觉得电玩退化了下一代的智能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...because he feels that the video games diminish the intelligence of our youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.20,0:07:47.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托 迪克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.00,0:07:50.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我们唯一的教育啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the only education we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.57,0:07:55.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪克 你是个坏蛋 你知道 我们对付坏蛋的方法...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a bad man. You know what we do to bad men.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.01,0:07:57.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是处罚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We punish them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.71,0:08:03.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪克 欢迎进入桑德特区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dick, you've just entered the Xander zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.12,0:08:07.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正带着一串条子往前冲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming in hot with a side of bacon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.03,0:08:17.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 快啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.62,0:08:39.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快拉开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull it! Pull it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.34,0:09:02.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.47,0:09:29.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去拿摄影机 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go get the cameras! Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.37,0:09:37.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教训你做人别太过份 迪克()\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moral is, don't be a dick, Dick!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.25,0:09:47.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿回摄影机了? 好 走人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys got the cameras? All right, let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.66,0:09:54.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再会啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peace out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.53,0:10:29.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Outstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.96,0:10:31.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.03,0:10:35.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 这些人是你请来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's up? - You invited these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.40,0:10:36.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.64,0:10:43.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好傢伙 你好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my dog! What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.58,0:10:46.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天真是太棒了 你真猛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today was off the hook! You're psycho, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.65,0:10:49.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猛? 简直是帅呆了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Psycho? That was off the chain, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.61,0:10:54.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有耍出那个超炫的动作吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, yo, yo! What's up with that crazy trick that we've been hearing about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.95,0:10:58.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 蜘蛛人空中翻滚技? - 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My Superman seat-grab barrel roll? - Word.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.42,0:11:00.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还在练习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm still working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.76,0:11:04.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真难找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a hard guy to get ahold of.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.30,0:11:09.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这种运动员 应该要有专属电玩游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, an athlete like you should really have his own video game.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.57,0:11:13.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金乔丹 我能帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jordan King. I can make it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.81,0:11:16.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我以后会再跟你联络 - 没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll hold on to this for later. - You do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.45,0:11:25.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不会出卖自己的 他就是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know he'll never sell out. That's why he is who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.75,0:11:28.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别烦他了 是谁请你来的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you need to relax. Who invited you, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.59,0:11:30.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.39,0:11:39.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 我是说真的 我能拿到网络预售的预付款\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, this is for real. I can get us an advance on Internet pre-sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.43,0:11:42.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只要去巴哥巴哥或哪里...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you need to just go to Pago Pago or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.57,0:11:45.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找女人 我无所谓 去渡个假\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get some girls, do them all. I don't care. Go on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.74,0:11:49.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是博拉博拉 这里的女人就够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Bora Bora, J. I got enough girls here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.61,0:11:52.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你何时开始这么爱钱的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since when did you care so much about money?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.58,0:11:55.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是要你先避避锋头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just need you to lay low till the heat's off, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.88,0:12:00.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我经营地下网站 我要卖录影带 但不要你坐牢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I run a secret website. I got tapes to make and I can't do that with you in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.95,0:12:04.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你看过了吗? - 我不管 听我的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you see that? - I don't care. Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.89,0:12:05.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是无敌的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm untouchable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.70,0:12:17.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趴下! 进去! 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go! Get out! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.14,0:12:19.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啦 我音乐会关小声一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I'll turn down the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.61,0:12:30.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不就一辆车而已吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was only a Corvette.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.55,0:12:37.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 菜都快凉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go, baby. Your order is getting cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.33,0:12:46.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 要来点咖啡吗? - 给我来点炒马铃薯吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Want coffee? - Can you give me some hash browns?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.26,0:12:49.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好 - 别炒过头了 我喜欢软一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sure. - Make them sloppy. I like them runny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.80,0:12:52.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么会在这里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did I get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.47,0:12:56.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个大个子十分钟前丢下你 叫我好好照雇你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two big guys dropped you off 10 minutes ago. Told me to look after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.11,0:12:59.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来点咖啡? 你看来很需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look like you could use some coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.83,0:13:17.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.66,0:13:19.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.81,0:13:37.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干嘛? 你有问题吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said, you got a problem, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.72,0:13:38.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没 没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.09,0:13:42.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 大家不准动 - 不准动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nobody make a move! - Nobody move!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.52,0:13:46.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想叫他去搬救兵? 闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just couldn't let him leave. Keep your goddamned mouth shut!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.13,0:13:51.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别乱动 不然你死定了 - 把钱全拿出来 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Keep still or you'll stop breathing. - Empty the goddamn register!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.37,0:13:58.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.34,0:14:00.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退后 退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back. Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.08,0:14:09.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 漂亮 大明星 - 你是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well done, Mr. Cage. - Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.12,0:14:13.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吉本斯 奥吉本斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The name's Gibbons. Augustus Gibbons.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.22,0:14:16.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你似乎很不爽 怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem upset. Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.02,0:14:19.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是什么地方? - 看起来是餐厅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is this place? - Looks like a diner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.86,0:14:21.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,答得真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.53,0:14:25.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你差一点就骗倒我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You almost had me going there for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.63,0:14:29.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一开始我有点头昏 后来我开始注意到一些事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was a bit groggy before, then I started noticing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.97,0:14:34.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里坐了个衣冠楚楚的分析师...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like, you got a stockbroker over here, all dressed up...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.21,0:14:39.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看工商时报 在股市休市的星期天早上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...reading the Financial Times on Sunday when the market's closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.61,0:14:43.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不太合理 但我还可以接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unlikely, but okay, I can go with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.21,0:14:47.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也能接受这个抢匪用警用的制式手枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could even go with the stick-up man packing a cop-issue Beretta.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.45,0:14:51.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道最大的问题出在哪吗? 就是她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you want to know where you blew it? With her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.86,0:14:54.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我舅妈在餐厅工作了一辈子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My aunt was in the restaurant business.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.86,0:14:59.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,专职女服务生绝不会穿高跟鞋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no way a career waitress comes to work in high heels.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.46,0:15:02.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样她的脚铁定会长水泡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'd have blisters the size of pancakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.37,0:15:05.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而如果她是假扮的 那这整个场景就是假的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if she ain't real, then this whole thing ain't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.14,0:15:09.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我知道这场戏再怎么演...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how I knew that this bozo wouldn't get a shot off...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.81,0:15:12.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这笨蛋也绝不会开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...even if we waited till St. Patrick's Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.81,0:15:17.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为枪里只有空包弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because there's nothing but blanks in these guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.85,0:15:22.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 我无意挑剔...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, and no offense...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.49,0:15:27.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他们的演技真是够烂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but their performances were terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.00,0:15:36.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's good. That's very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.74,0:15:39.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该你了 大帅哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your turn, pretty boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.71,0:15:45.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这到底是怎么回事? - 这是测验 你高分通过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell is going on here? - It was a test that you aced.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.44,0:15:50.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他的态度不太好 - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He seems to have a poor attitude. - Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.72,0:15:54.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 要不要把他扔回去? - 不 我喜欢他的态度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Should we throw him back? - Hell, no. I love his attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.49,0:15:57.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进行下一步 快去联络\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's take this to the next level. Get on the Sat-Com.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.66,0:15:59.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么下一步?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take what to the next level?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.03,0:16:03.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你! 什么下一步? - 全员十分钟内离去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yo! Take what? - I want everybody out in 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.36,0:16:06.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不奉陪 我没时间陪你玩游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't play this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.40,0:16:09.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 送麦克就医 否则他脸就毁了 - 我还要回派对去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get Mike a doctor or he'll look like me. - I got a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.07,0:16:12.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 让他闭嘴 - 别忘了赔我窗户钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shut him up. - And pay for my windows!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.91,0:16:23.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么通过测验的老是些烂人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is it always the assholes who pass the tests?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.91,0:16:50.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们最近不会都到过餐厅吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys haven't been to any diners lately, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.68,0:16:54.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,餐厅胜出者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diner finalists.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.09,0:17:04.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么 没咖啡啊? - 好耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What, no coffee? - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.02,0:17:07.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 指挥军官在此 - 开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here comes the ROTC. - Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.59,0:17:10.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我的花生米呢? - 酷啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's my peanuts? - Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.63,0:17:14.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮我叫空姐过来一下吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you ask for the stewardess?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.94,0:17:22.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 预备放减速伞 - 知道了 减速伞预备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Standing by to deploy drogue. - Roger, deploying drogue parachute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.02,0:17:33.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这会很痛 - 这是在搞什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This will hurt. - What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.47,0:17:50.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 放出减速伞 - 知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Release drogue now. - Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.70,0:17:55.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This ain't right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.17,0:17:56.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这算不了什么!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I live for this shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.69,0:18:17.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不赖嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.73,0:18:21.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再来一次吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's do that again!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.55,0:18:38.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死 这里是哥伦比亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit. This is Colombia.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.78,0:18:41.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可卡因 这些都是可卡因树\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cocaine, man. These are coke plants!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.69,0:18:49.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.96,0:18:55.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你在干嘛? - 这些可值钱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell are you doing? - You know what this shit's worth?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.20,0:19:00.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么? 测验人员来了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What now? Is this another test?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.24,0:19:03.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们过河去 快 - 是啊 快跑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's go across the river. Let's go! - Yeah, good idea! Good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.72,0:19:15.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们真是比我强太多了 我想我测验不及格了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You monkeys are too good for me. I failed this test.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.96,0:19:20.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们有带喝的吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys got something to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.94,0:19:34.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真高兴又见面了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice to see you again, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.07,0:19:36.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.74,0:19:40.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们这回可真是大费周章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boy, they went all out on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.94,0:20:10.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got to be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.55,0:20:19.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 笨蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, funny guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.12,0:20:23.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见识一下我们怎么处置入侵者吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll show you what we do when you get in our business.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.99,0:20:28.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绑住我们 逼我们听你讲话?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Hog-tie us and force us to listen to your bad accent?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.96,0:20:30.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.86,0:20:35.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们砍断他们的脚筋 看着他们痛苦挣扎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cut their Achilles tendon and watch them flop around like a marionette.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.13,0:20:40.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非你要跟我说重要的情报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless you have something to tell me, something I need to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.04,0:20:43.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 你很矮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. You're short.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.31,0:20:50.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我朋友说你可以去换个发型 放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friend says you could use a haircut to update your style. Get off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.48,0:20:54.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.59,0:20:58.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚才叫我们讲话 现在却要我们闭嘴?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two seconds ago you told us to talk. Now it's "Shut up?"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.32,0:21:02.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我无意挑剔 但你真不会逼供\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't mean to nitpick, but you're the worst at this torture thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.10,0:21:08.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你再打我 我就扁死你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You slap me again, I'm going to throw you a beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.37,0:21:16.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你这样有领比较多的酬劳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope they're paying you extra for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.34,0:21:21.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样吧 也许我该先割了你的鼻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what, funny guy? Maybe I'll cut off your nose first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.58,0:21:23.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Funny guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.15,0:21:28.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怪了 这上面有真正的血腥味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's funny is, this actually smells like real blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.19,0:21:34.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你喜欢 这会是你最后闻到的东西了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you like it, because it's the last thing you're going to smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.32,0:22:02.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我中枪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm hit! I'm hit! I'm hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.59,0:22:10.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,维多 快帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Virg! Give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.51,0:22:22.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是哥伦比亚政府军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the Colombian army!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.67,0:22:24.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快投降 你们已被包围!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give up, you're surrounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.08,0:22:31.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己走 小杰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try to walk, T.J. Try to walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.48,0:22:33.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,维多 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Virg! Get out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.59,0:22:37.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去他的 人不为己天诛地灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To hell with this. Every man for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.61,0:23:02.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去找交通工具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get us some wheels.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.35,0:23:04.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这等着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.08,0:23:06.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.06,0:24:21.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个骑机车的就是毒枭!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The guy on the bike, that's the drug lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.03,0:24:23.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逮住他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.88,0:24:41.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小杰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}T.J.!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.19,0:26:02.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,X 我在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}X! I'm over here! X!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.15,0:26:22.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在那里!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.08,0:27:32.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们把他烤焦了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We toasted his ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.63,0:27:44.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我弄了一辆机车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got us a bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.94,0:27:52.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胆小鬼!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pussies!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.64,0:28:06.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看谁来了 科学怪人 打开我的手铐 我要扁死你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look who it is. Frankenstein. Uncuff me so I can beat the shit out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.72,0:28:10.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别激动 你刚以第一名毕业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax, X, you just graduated at the head of your class.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.19,0:28:13.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在胡说什么? 你差点害死我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about? You almost got us killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.02,0:28:16.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们知道哥国军队正在逼近 - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We knew the army was moving. - Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.73,0:28:20.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我建议拿你当诱饵 怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was my idea to send you as a decoy. How do you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.50,0:28:27.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你真是个身手矫健的老人 - 起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're pretty fast for an old man. - Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.51,0:28:32.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陪我走一走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walk with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.91,0:28:38.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信只要有好的环境 人是会改变的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe under the right circumstances, a man can change.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.75,0:28:42.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,举例来说 昨晚你展现了 勇气 领导能力...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For instance, last night you exhibited courage, leadership...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.79,0:28:45.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还愿意保护一个陌生人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and willingness to protect a man you hardly knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.59,0:28:48.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 颁个勋章给我好了 - 我宁可给你一份工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So give me a medal. - I'd rather give you a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.29,0:28:53.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看看我 我看起来像是执法人员吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me. Do I look like a fan of law enforcement?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.43,0:28:55.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是你的幸运日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your lucky day, Xander.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.80,0:28:58.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有机会可以报答国家...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your chance to pay your Uncle Sam...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.70,0:29:00.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感谢它让你享受自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for all your wonderful freedoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.11,0:29:02.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,工作本身并不难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The job's not that difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.14,0:29:06.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是要你去见一些人...查明他们的底细\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to meet people and find out what you can about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.94,0:29:08.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那一种人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What type of people?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.81,0:29:14.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险 下流 野蛮 你们那种人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dangerous, dirty, tattooed, uncivilized. Your kind of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.35,0:29:16.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.79,0:29:22.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这种人会说: "亲我的屁股吧 大花脸"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My kind of people would say, "Kiss my ass, scarface."
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.63,0:29:26.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,此时我通常会拔枪相向 再礼貌地...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Usually I'd take my gun, press it to your temple...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.96,0:29:29.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你照我的话去做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and ask you very politely to do what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.17,0:29:33.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你并不怕死 这让我们陷入了窘境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're not afraid of death. That puts us in a quandary.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.97,0:29:37.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我想讨论就到此结束  - 还没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We better call this a day, then. - Not just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.71,0:29:41.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看过动物园里的狮子吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever watch lions at the zoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.35,0:29:46.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,透过它们的眼睛 你就能分辨哪只是野生的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can tell which were captured in the wild by the look in their eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.08,0:29:48.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大野猫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The wild cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.99,0:29:52.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它记得奔驰草原的快乐 猎杀的快感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She remembers running across the plain, the thrill of the hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.56,0:29:56.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,400磅的猎杀高手被关着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four hundred pounds of killing fury locked in a box.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.20,0:29:59.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过一阵子 它们眼神变得呆滞...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But after a while, their eyes glaze over...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.26,0:30:03.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看得出它的灵魂已死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and you can tell their soul has died.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.57,0:30:05.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人也是一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The same thing happens to a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.97,0:30:08.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,联邦监狱可不是儿童乐园\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leavenworth Federal Penitentiary is no joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.81,0:30:12.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会把你这种狂人...丢进单人牢房取乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll take a wild man and throw him in solitary just for fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.24,0:30:18.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不再有山可爬 不再有浪可冲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more mountains to board, no more oceans to surf.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.75,0:30:24.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有一个小牢房 不见天日 只有一个粪桶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a 6-by-8 cell with no window and only a bucket to shit in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.92,0:30:27.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你只要帮个忙 就能免去一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can avoid that by doing me this favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.79,0:30:29.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你根本没有我的把柄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have shit on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.09,0:30:34.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我注意到你的后颈...有三个"X"的刺青\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I noticed you have three X's tattooed on the back of your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.43,0:30:39.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得那挺适合你的 因为你背负三项罪名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that's rather appropriate since you're looking at three strikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.00,0:30:44.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偷车 危害公安 还有你那个跳桥特技...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grand theft, reckless endangerment, and that bridge stunt of yours...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.84,0:30:47.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你彻底输了三次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...makes you a three-time loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.38,0:30:50.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许你该自称为"XXX"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you ought to call yourself "Triple X."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.35,0:30:56.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果你照我的话去做 我就让你无罪开释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you do what I want, I'll make all your transgressions go away...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.19,0:30:59.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你回去过你那可笑的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and let you get back to that pathetic excuse of a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.86,0:31:04.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者你认为我该跟你一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or you think maybe I should be like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.83,0:31:08.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被打个脸上开花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get all shot up for the old Stars and Stripes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.43,0:31:13.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你每回照镜子时一定很自傲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bet that flag is a real comfort every time you look in the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.04,0:31:18.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这只是个我为国付出的小代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A small price I paid for putting foot to ass for my country.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.61,0:31:26.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样 XXX?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what's it going to be, Triple X?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.55,0:31:29.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想立刻上路...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to get on a plane...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.22,0:31:33.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是给我一句: "亲我的屁股 大花脸"?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or is "Kiss my ass, scarface" your final answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.17,0:31:47.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(博拉格 捷克)
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.89,0:32:04.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo. What's your name, slick?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.92,0:32:06.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫伊凡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Ivan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.39,0:32:10.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 伊凡? 那你呢? - 我叫伊凡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ivan? What's your name, buddy? - My name is Ivan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.73,0:32:12.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们都叫伊凡?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're both Ivan?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.86,0:32:43.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.26,0:32:46.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 美国探员呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Idiots! Where is the American agent?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.13,0:32:48.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is him, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.83,0:32:52.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们最好再订个装尸袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We better order another bodybag.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.27,0:32:55.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么事吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.84,0:32:58.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫你坐下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you to sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.64,0:33:02.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在飞机上坐半天了 我想站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've just been on a plane for 12 hours. I think I'll stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.58,0:33:05.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是苏米兰 捷克秘密警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Milan Sova, Czech secret police.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.95,0:33:08.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到这里 就得受我管辖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, you are under my jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.69,0:33:11.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听我的命令 照我的话去做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take my orders, you do what I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.29,0:33:14.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你变得碍手碍脚 我就杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you become any kind of an inconvenience, I'll shoot you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.23,0:33:17.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 我就住这?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's great. Is this where I'm staying?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.03,0:33:21.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会在此是因你的政府逼我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your government is putting pressure on mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.47,0:33:25.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一桩国内事务 你们这是干涉捷克内政\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is an internal Czech affair that you are interfering with.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.54,0:33:28.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我警告你 别在我家撒野\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will warn you once: Don't shit in my lawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.67,0:33:33.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,取得你们政府想要的情报后...就快点滚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get whatever information your government seeks and get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.81,0:33:35.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明人不说暗话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.51,0:33:39.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也许不想让我来 而我根本也不想来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may not want me here, but I definitely don't want to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.45,0:33:42.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再说 我没受任何人管辖过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two, I've never been under anyone's jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.49,0:33:45.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第三 如果你想杀人...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three, if you're going to shoot anybody...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.09,0:33:48.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去杀卖这套衣服给你的人吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...shoot that monkey that sold you the suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.83,0:33:51.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很累 我要睡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I'm tired. I'm going to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.36,0:33:55.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三小时后出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be ready in three hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.54,0:34:03.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,俱乐部里的人有两个共通点: \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody in this club has two things in common:
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.51,0:34:09.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他们都很有钱 也都是罪犯 - 我绝对合适 只是我并没有钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They're rich and they're criminals. - I'll fit in, except for the rich part.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.96,0:34:27.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 记住 我们互不相识 - 真希望是如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Remember, we don't know each other. - I wish we didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.71,0:34:44.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我来杯红莓苏打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, can I get a cranberry club soda?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.25,0:34:48.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这放后面 我会给你小费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Throw this back there? I'll tip you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.05,0:34:51.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就放后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put it in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.62,0:34:55.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这要多少? 有存根吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much? Do I get a ticket?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.50,0:35:03.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在那里 无政府99\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's them. Anarchy 99.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.90,0:35:05.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看见坐在中间沙发那个人了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see the guy on the couch?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.94,0:35:08.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是尤里 他是老大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Yorgi. He's the leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.57,0:35:13.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他拥有六间这样的俱乐部 全都是金鸡母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He owns this club and five others like it. All, how do you say, cash cows.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.41,0:35:14.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国佬?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}American?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.78,0:35:20.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是美国人 我要见尤里 尤里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, I'm American. I'm going to see Yorgi. Yorgi!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.22,0:35:23.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤里 听说你就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Yorgi! I hear you're the guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.36,0:35:29.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听说可以找你买车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard you're the guy to talk to about cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.96,0:35:31.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take yourself outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.70,0:35:33.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出去? 我才刚...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take myself outside? I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.80,0:35:38.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我不受欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. I'm not welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.57,0:35:41.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许你宁愿条子进你的俱乐部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess you'd rather have cops in your club.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.54,0:35:45.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想谈谈吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Want to talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.04,0:35:49.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来告诉我哪个是条子...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you silly boy. Come with me and show me the cop...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.85,0:35:51.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别弄错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and don't be mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.08,0:35:55.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到那个傢伙了? 穿得很蠢的那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See that guy there, with the suit made out of drapes?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.59,0:35:57.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个就是条子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.26,0:36:05.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了? 我才刚喝一杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there a problem? I just had a drink, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.10,0:36:10.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我付过钱了 我会给很大一笔小费的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I already paid. I'm going to give a big tip, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.17,0:36:20.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是干嘛? 我什么都没做啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what is this all about? I've done nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.05,0:36:24.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都没做? 你是做什么的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've done nothing? Who do you work for?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.45,0:36:27.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在银行工作 怎么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I work in a bank. So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.42,0:36:30.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少扯了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got to be....
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.75,0:36:34.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干嘛? 住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing? Stop it! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.29,0:36:38.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么? 学生证吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that, your bus pass?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.76,0:36:41.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,捷克警察 捷克警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Czech 5-0. Czech 5-0.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.03,0:36:45.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave my club.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.47,0:36:49.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.07,0:36:55.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么知道? 他付钱的时候...警徽反光差点害我瞎掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When he was paying for his drinks, he was flashing his badge to half the bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.55,0:36:56.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,条子跟蟑螂一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cops like plague.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.91,0:37:00.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管收买多少 总还有人要钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No matter how many you pay, there's always another with his hand out.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.12,0:37:03.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是混道上的 我了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm from the streets. I know cops, believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.72,0:37:08.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很感谢你引起我们注意 问题是为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I appreciate you bringing this to our attention. My question to you is why?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.89,0:37:11.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想没人喜欢条子混进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I figure, no one likes cops crashing their party.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.96,0:37:14.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我帮你忙 就能说上话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I figure, I do you a solid, we could talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.23,0:37:18.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想买车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want to buy cars, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.14,0:37:22.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这傢伙是不是想上我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this guy going to hump my leg?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.14,0:37:25.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.08,0:37:29.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桑德·凯吉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Xander Cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.48,0:37:33.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.18,0:37:37.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你玩滑雪板 机车...样样都行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are amazing on snowboard, motorbike, everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.49,0:37:39.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你真行 - 谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're awesome. - Thank you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.09,0:37:44.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我弟有点疯 他也很崇拜你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My brother is crazy too, and a great admirer of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.53,0:37:48.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他看过很多你的带子 来谈吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has seen your tapes many times. Now we can talk business.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.30,0:37:49.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请这边来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.57,0:37:52.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yelena.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.41,0:37:57.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎进入桑德特区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the Xander zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.94,0:38:00.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有趣 真有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, that's funny. That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.94,0:38:02.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐 凯吉先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down, Mr. Cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.01,0:38:04.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我朋友都叫我X\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My friends call me X.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.98,0:38:07.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,X 你想要什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, X, what exactly are you wanting?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.95,0:38:13.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,法拉利 高级跑车 先买十辆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ferraris, high-end pasta rockets, 10 to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.16,0:38:20.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这辆车 第十辆 在欧洲很难找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This car, number 10, will be very difficult to find in Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.80,0:38:25.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 那辆是我要的 我把它列进去 是想从中获利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That one's for me. I put it in there to get something out of the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.14,0:38:27.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你果然很懂车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you certainly know your cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.97,0:38:31.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 汽车 机车 滑板...我全都行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Cars, bikes, boards. You name it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.68,0:38:34.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢快速又能耍特技的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like anything fast enough to do something stupid in.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.98,0:38:36.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.18,0:38:40.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十辆车根本没利润可言 我们出价一百五十万美金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten cars is hardly worth the effort. A lousy 1.5 million, U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.25,0:38:43.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.35,0:38:48.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对我背后的美国金主而言 这十辆只是开胃小菜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The American buyers I represent, to them, 10 cars is an appetizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.76,0:38:52.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 最多一百万 阿姐 - 一百四十万吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And it's a mil max, sister. - How about a million four?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.73,0:38:55.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想最多一百二万\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was thinking more like a mil two.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.37,0:39:01.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道什么是电汇吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what a wire transfer is?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.37,0:39:02.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不是来闹场的吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is she for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.11,0:39:05.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿姐 你没别的事好做了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweetheart, is there anything you need to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.04,0:39:09.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男人谈生意女人少插嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let us big boys have a conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.35,0:39:12.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谈生意是要用大脑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Conversation," a word with four syllables.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.18,0:39:15.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要不要先去装个脑袋?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want some ice before your brain overheats?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.42,0:39:20.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 你也先去装颗心吧 如果你找得到心的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ice. Yeah, you could chisel some off your heart, if you could find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.23,0:39:24.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.53,0:39:30.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一切会尽快进行 只要你给我帐号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This would work a lot faster, princess, if I had an account number.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.44,0:39:39.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有48小时的时间汇款\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have 48 hours to complete the transfer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.44,0:39:42.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别浪费我的时间 - 喔 我哪敢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't waste my time. - I wouldn't dream of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.11,0:39:48.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上 我会多汇几块送你上礼仪学校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I might throw in a couple extra bucks and send you to charm school.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.46,0:39:56.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生意谈完 来狂欢吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that business is finished, we party.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.16,0:40:00.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辣妹们 进来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bitches, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.69,0:40:28.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.40,0:40:36.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见鬼 我以为这只是手机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit, I thought this was a cell phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.07,0:40:38.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睡得甜吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have a nice rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.77,0:40:41.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小声点 我一小时前才睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dial it down. I got to sleep an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.41,0:40:45.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们给你一份特别准备的清单 谁教你变更的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were given a specific list of cars. Who told you to alter it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.68,0:40:48.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,清单上的车很烂 他们会看穿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cars sucked. They would've seen through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.78,0:40:51.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们真该换旅行社\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys should switch travel agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.98,0:40:54.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经弄到你要的情报了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got that info you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.25,0:40:56.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.32,0:40:58.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys ready for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.69,0:41:07.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姓名 生日 红军军阶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Names, birthdays, ranks in the Red Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.60,0:41:09.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱吃的东西? 你怎么弄到的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Favorite foods? How did you get this?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.10,0:41:14.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,柯亚 尤里的小弟 他刚好是极限运动的爱好者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kolya, Yorgi's younger brother, happens to be an action sports fanatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.27,0:41:15.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以他很崇拜我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So naturally, he's a fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.01,0:41:19.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等他猛灌三瓶伏特加之后 他就无话不说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when you kill a bottle of vodka in three swigs, you'll talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.88,0:41:21.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我还有东西要给你  - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got something else. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.01,0:41:25.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的个人银行帐号 我放到哪去了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their personal bank account number. Where did I put that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.72,0:41:34.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偷车 夜总会 应召站 勒索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stolen cars, nightclubs, prostitution, extortion.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.29,0:41:37.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些人有什么特别的? 这种人我们美国多得是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the big deal? We got criminals like this in the U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.06,0:41:40.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你负责搜集情报 不是问问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your job isn't to ask questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.63,0:41:44.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我功成身退 谢谢 我要回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I did my job, thank you. I'm coming home.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.84,0:41:46.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.24,0:41:50.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的称职害了你自己 我要你接近这些人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a victim of your own success. Get closer to these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.97,0:41:54.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这些人是酷 但还不够酷 - 更深入一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They're cool, but not that cool. - Go deeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.38,0:41:57.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会派人带些道具去帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll send a guy with a care package to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.21,0:42:01.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我以为我们谈好的 - 你变更车子 我变更交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I thought we had a deal. - You change cars, I change the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.15,0:42:04.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮我这个忙 你就能回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do this for me, you can come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.52,0:42:09.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要派人拯救世界 也要确定那人喜欢这世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you send someone to save the world, make sure they like it the way it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.84,0:42:25.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的胸肌很壮 我卧推能举225磅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a really firm chest. I bench, like, 225.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.31,0:42:28.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卧推举 在举重室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like, bench. Weight room. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.31,0:42:32.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 就是他 - 等等 你就是XXX?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's him. - Wait. You're Triple X?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.95,0:42:36.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你就是送道具的? - 对 李托比探员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're the care package? - Agent Toby Lee Shavers.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.79,0:42:38.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.22,0:42:41.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吉本斯会送货来 你一定很重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to rate high to get Gibbons to send this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.96,0:42:46.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真希望能跟你一起行动 实地打击罪犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I kind of wish I was going with you, mixed up in the fury of the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.03,0:42:50.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真够猛的 杀人 毁灭 搞破坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crazy. License to kill, death, destruction, mayhem.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.40,0:42:55.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,枕头底下放枪 超级大坏蛋随时都可能跳出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got a gun under your pillow. Never know when some freak villain will pop out.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.97,0:42:59.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你当探员多久了? - 两天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How long you been with the agency? - Two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.31,0:43:01.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见鬼 不会吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're shitting me. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.11,0:43:04.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真差劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.72,0:43:06.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是很差劲 但比坐牢好多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it sucks, but it beats jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.08,0:43:09.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差劲的是 我耗了六年时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It sucks because I spent six years...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.55,0:43:14.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待在暗无天日的道具室里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in the basement of some windowless, NSA, gadget freak room, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.22,0:43:16.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有学位 我是麻省理工的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I got a degree. I got a degree from MlT.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.89,0:43:19.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是第一名毕业的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phi Beta Kappa, magna cum laude.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.93,0:43:24.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而他们挑中你的原因 是你在牢里很会扛砖头?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they probably picked you up, what, pumping iron in San Quentin?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.94,0:43:28.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有没有因为多话被扁过?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever get punched in the face for talking too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.41,0:43:29.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把东西拿给我看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me the stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.87,0:43:34.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的精心杰作 完美的典范\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one made my career, the definition of perfection:
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.64,0:43:38.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多目标多功能连发手枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My multi-purpose, multi-function field revolver.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.15,0:43:43.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢 - 那你会爱死这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, I like this. - Then you'll love these.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.72,0:43:47.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些是附属子弹 什么都有 看见绿色的了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are all attachment darts. See the green ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.42,0:43:49.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻醉子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Datura knockout darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.56,0:43:53.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,砰! 中弹者会倒下12小时 醒来后不知身在何处...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guy goes down for 12 hours, wakes up, doesn't know who he is...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.73,0:43:57.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会头痛欲裂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and his head's splitting like a cord of firewood.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.37,0:44:00.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我被那种子弹打中两次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was shot twice by those.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.34,0:44:03.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有红色的 这是镇静喷血弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the red ones are tranquilizer and blood-splatter darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.01,0:44:07.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中弹后的假死样子很逼真 跟死了一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like a kill shot without the aftereffects. Like death.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.08,0:44:10.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有爆破弹 无线电追踪弹...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got exploding and surveillance darts...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.81,0:44:15.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有标准的点44子弹 如果你想开杀戒的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and your standard .44-caliber bullets, if you want to get nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.75,0:44:19.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喷洒点鲜血 你懂我在说什么吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little wet work. You know what I'm talking about, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.63,0:44:25.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定抢过便利商店吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knocked over a few 7-Elevens, have we?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.93,0:44:30.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没 倒是腿上上过石膏 我只能在家玩射击电玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I had my leg in a cast for three months. All I did was play video games.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.17,0:44:32.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是个悲伤的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a really sad story.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.14,0:44:35.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 看看我的宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check this out, on to my baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.01,0:44:40.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鹰眼 有九种视觉强化模式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eagle Eyes. Nine enhanced-vision modes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.91,0:44:45.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个小男孩的梦想 透视模式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every little boy's dream: the penetrator mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.18,0:44:46.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.96,0:44:57.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖乖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.66,0:45:01.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她在看你 - 这个我要了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She's checking you out, man. - I'll hang on to these.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.63,0:45:03.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接着 我最新的发明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, on to my latest achievement.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.23,0:45:07.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我上周才完成的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just put the finishing touches on them last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.24,0:45:09.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.17,0:45:13.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 绷带 - 不 你看着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bandages? - No, Mr. X, watch and learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.24,0:45:16.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上面的火药足以炸穿墙壁...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's enough primer to blow a hole in a vault...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.55,0:45:20.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,炸死人 或任何你想炸的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...vaporize a human, or whatever agents like you might find a use for.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.85,0:45:22.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.49,0:45:24.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是引爆器 够酷吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The detonator. How cool is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.82,0:45:31.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你最好退后一点 - 那只是绷带罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You might want to back up for this. - It's a bandage.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.56,0:45:33.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,躲到墙后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just get behind the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.33,0:45:36.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.87,0:45:38.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直想说这句话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've always wanted to say this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.50,0:45:41.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,引爆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire in the hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.79,0:46:06.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,子弹已经上膛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.79,0:46:32.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样? 太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what do you think? Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.56,0:46:35.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喜欢这些车?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You like the cars?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.56,0:46:39.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢 真棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love the cars, they're dope.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.23,0:46:44.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你喜欢那笔钱吧? - 我喜欢 但我还没拿到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You like the money? - I love money, but I do not have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.23,0:46:48.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看来混得不错 这些手下 名车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look like you're doing very well. All these employees, beautiful cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.14,0:46:51.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没时间跟你胡扯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is no time for being funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.41,0:46:53.17,Default,NTP,0,0,10,,(帐户余额120万)
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.34,0:46:55.00,Default,NTP,0,0,10,,(款项收讫)
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.59,0:47:09.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你不会以为我会赖帐吧? - 我想都没想过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You didn't think I wasn't good for it? - It never crossed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.00,0:47:16.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,港口有艘货轮在等着 这是地址\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A cargo ship's waiting for you in Rijeka. Here's the address.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.04,0:47:20.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里真棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place is dope.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.27,0:47:23.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这辆是我的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one's mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.04,0:47:25.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第十辆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Car number 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.94,0:47:29.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,柯亚在柏林找到的 它很难找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kolya found it hiding in Berlin. It was very difficult to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.98,0:47:31.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.72,0:47:34.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我来 你很慷慨的付了钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Allow me. You were kind enough to give me the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.33,0:47:44.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, please...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.00,0:47:46.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开车吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.13,0:47:52.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 让我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, allow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.05,0:48:09.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你挺正点的 尤里 - 有伏特加一切好办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're all right, Yorgi. - Everything's all right with vodka.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.85,0:48:13.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你今晚务必来参加派对 就在我的俱乐部里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must come to party tonight. Big party at one of my clubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.19,0:48:15.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是吗? - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.55,0:48:37.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on, my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.88,0:48:41.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道 你说呢 你在上面埋伏了人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tell me. You got a sniper up there or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.38,0:48:43.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是我们的人 是跟你来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not with us, he must be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.85,0:48:46.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胡扯 叫你的人下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bullshit! Tell your men to get down...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.09,0:48:50.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然我就在你身上多开一个洞 听清楚了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or I'll give you another hole to breathe out of. Are we clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.87,0:48:59.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 他不是你的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. It's not yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.24,0:49:01.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一起去逮他吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go and get him together.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.07,0:49:37.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈的 是之前闯俱乐部的条子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch. That same cop from the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.17,0:49:39.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,烂条子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Filthy cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.61,0:50:13.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很多人会放狠话 但能冷静行动的人不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most people talk a lot. Few are up for the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.11,0:50:17.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎你加入无政府99\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Anarchy 99.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.03,0:51:10.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干嘛这么对待自己? 香烟迟早会要了你的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you do that to yourself? That cigarette will kill you one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.17,0:51:15.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢烟雾胜于空气 可以的话 我连睡觉都想吸烟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like smoke better than air. If I could, I'd smoke in my sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.17,0:51:18.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算它害死我 我死后还想抽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would still do it after it kills me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.19,0:51:39.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你之前提到无政府99\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were talking about Anarchy 99.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.20,0:51:42.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么? 你的机车俱乐部?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that, some motorcycle gang of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.77,0:51:48.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 是我们99年离开俄国红军后所过的日子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's what we've been living since 1999 when we left the army of Mother Russia.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.27,0:51:53.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有许多同志死于战争 我们受够这一切了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Many of our comrades died in combat, and we said, "To hell with this shit."
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.28,0:51:55.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们为何而死? 政治?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They die for what? Politics?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.88,0:51:58.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁的政治? 不是我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whose politics? Not ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.58,0:52:02.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们当时决定从此要为所欲为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we decide from then on to do what we want, when we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.89,0:52:07.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为纪念他们 我们自称无政府99\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is in their honor we call ourselves Anarchy 99.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.93,0:52:16.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有首老庞克歌曲 歌词说: \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, there's an old punk song. It says:
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.27,0:52:18.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国代表自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}America stands for freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.64,0:52:20.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你若自以为自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you think you're free
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.34,0:52:23.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去趟小吃店 在小菜上撒泡尿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try walkin into a deli and urinating on the cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.05,0:52:27.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你知道! - 汪达合唱团的"无政府汉堡"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You got it! - "Anarchy Burger" by the Vandals.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.65,0:52:31.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我赞成你 但你要怎么做?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm with you, but what are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.49,0:52:36.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到处都有法规 都有政府 以前有 以后也会一直有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got rules and government everywhere. Always was, always will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.43,0:52:38.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许不会一直有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe not always.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.60,0:52:47.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让他寂寞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make sure he doesn't get lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.50,0:52:49.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.28,0:52:59.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想跳舞吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.05,0:53:06.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 喂!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.36,0:53:16.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂! 我舞技很棒的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! I'm really a good dancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.87,0:53:23.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来两杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make that two.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.07,0:53:27.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 你打算一直这样对我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, it's going to be like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.88,0:53:31.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你气他 也别拿我出气啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're mad at him, don't take it out on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.55,0:53:36.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直在想你们俩的关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been trying to figure out the deal between you two all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.32,0:53:39.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是他的女人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You his woman or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.99,0:53:44.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 我是...若付我一样多钱 我也能跟你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm his woman. If you pay me as much, I'll be your woman too.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.54,0:54:39.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你喜欢吗? - 喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you enjoy that? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.28,0:54:42.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 因为它不会再发生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good, because it will never happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.68,0:55:44.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来的堡主有一天决定落跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The original owners just one day decide to move out.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.08,0:55:48.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这里真棒 - 请不要拘礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is amazing, man. - Make yourself at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.06,0:55:56.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我帮你拿外套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me get your coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.57,0:56:07.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那小子怎么了? 他喜欢外套?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's up with your boy? He got a coat fetish?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.54,0:56:09.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.44,0:56:13.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他爱上她了 笨蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's in love with her. Dirty fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.25,0:56:29.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该上床了 天快亮了 约娜!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time for bed, X. It's getting early. Yelena!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.33,0:56:32.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你带他去他的房间吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you kindly show him his room?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.68,0:56:51.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你先请  - 不 你先\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- After you. - No, after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.45,0:56:54.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不 你先  - 不 我坚持\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, after you. - No, I insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.52,0:57:00.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.26,0:57:05.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我上床的最后一次机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last chance to tuck me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.43,0:57:08.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你好梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.51,0:58:01.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要为国奋战一番\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The things I'm going to do for my country.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.57,0:59:35.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不关我的事 但是用电钻...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's none of my business, but a power drill and some titanium bits...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.90,0:59:37.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会比用相机有用多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...will get you a lot further than that camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.87,0:59:40.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不该在这里的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not supposed to be in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.27,0:59:42.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本来是想去上厕所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was on my way to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.84,0:59:46.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的借口呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your excuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.45,0:59:49.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不需要借口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need an excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.22,0:59:53.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.22,0:59:56.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但还不够行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But not that good.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.12,1:00:00.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是来拍摄尤里的保险箱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came in here to photograph Yorgi's safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.63,1:00:03.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我觉得它可能很值钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it might be worth a lot to somebody.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.46,1:00:07.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托 你冷血 聪明又危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. You're cold, intelligent and vicious.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.24,1:00:11.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的眼神泄露了你的身分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your eyes that give you away.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.67,1:00:15.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在我射杀那条子的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They gave you away when I shot that cop.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.94,1:00:19.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在打算怎么做?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you going to do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.08,1:00:26.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在要请你吃午餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I'm going to take you to lunch.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.59,1:00:32.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有 我杀的那个条子 他没死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, and that cop I shot, isn't dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.71,1:00:55.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有情报要给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have some information for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.05,1:01:02.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直都用得上情报 你是谁? 你怎会有我的号码?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can always use information. Who is this? How did you get this number?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.12,1:01:08.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于桑德·凯吉的重要情报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Important information that you need about Xander Cage.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.64,1:01:22.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你不喜欢外国人? - 没错 你是一只猪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So you don't like foreigners, do you? - No, you're a pig.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.18,1:01:26.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的相好呢? 他也是猪?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is your boyfriend a pig too?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.41,1:01:29.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该认得你的同类啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should recognize one of your kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.18,1:01:31.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我条子的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, tell me about the cop.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.25,1:01:36.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若我说我跟你想像的不一样 你会怎么说?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if I told you I'm not who you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.09,1:01:40.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以帮你解决你的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That I could get you out of the mess you're in?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.26,1:01:42.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗? 我有什么问题?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? And what mess am I in?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.70,1:01:47.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它让你趁大家熟睡时 蹑手蹑脚刺探情报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mess that makes you sneak around the castle when everyone's asleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.97,1:01:49.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,条子的事呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cop?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.20,1:01:55.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看这个 这叫镇静喷血弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See this? It's called a blood-splatter dart.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.14,1:02:00.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撞击很真实 但却无害 主要是红色颜料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The impact's real, but it's harmless. Red paint, mostly.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.35,1:02:03.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.28,1:02:06.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是个情报员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a secret agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.69,1:02:16.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这不是在糗我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure you don't want to embarrass me?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.03,1:02:19.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 拜托 - 有这么好笑吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. - What's so funny about that?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.03,1:02:23.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看看你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, look at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.57,1:02:26.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我隶属于美国国安局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I work for the NSA.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.64,1:02:30.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真会搞笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're funny, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.91,1:02:36.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约娜 我是阿奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yelena, it's Kirill.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.18,1:02:40.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤里发现凯吉是美国情报员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yorgi found out that Cage is an American agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.65,1:02:46.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我在说什么吗? 你有危险 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you understand what I'm telling you? You are in danger, my love.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.33,1:02:49.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对街的大楼 雕像后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The building across the street. The statue.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.36,1:02:54.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带他出来 其他的由我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring him outside. I will do the rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.44,1:03:03.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁? 你的相好?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that, your boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.95,1:03:13.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假设你说的是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's say you are who you say you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.09,1:03:18.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你能帮我做些什么? - 你想要什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What can you do for me? - What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.53,1:03:24.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要免于起诉权 美国给我政治庇护和公民身分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want immunity from prosecution, asylum in the U.S. and citizenship.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.20,1:03:27.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住迈阿密 外加一个有钱男友?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about a condo on South Beach and a rich boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.77,1:03:29.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些我自己来就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those I can get for myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.20,1:03:34.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你要我怎么做? - 我要知道无政府99的详情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you want? - I need to know more about Anarchy 99.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.74,1:03:37.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想知道详情?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to know about Anarchy 99?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.84,1:03:41.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到辣妹 俱乐部和派对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've seen the girls, the clubs, the parties.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.45,1:03:45.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你看不到白天发生的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you don't see is what goes on during the day.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.78,1:03:50.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去年活动很频繁 人们进进出出的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's been a lot of activity in the last year. People coming in and out.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.06,1:03:54.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 俄罗斯科学家 - 他们在干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Russian scientists. - Well, what are they up to?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.39,1:03:58.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道 他们在地下室 我不能去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They go in the basement and I'm not allowed in.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.03,1:04:01.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在是你设法进去的好时机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now's a good time for you to get invited.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.53,1:04:08.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤里知道你是情报员 阿奇正在外面拿枪指着你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yorgi knows you're an agent. Kirill is waiting with his rifle.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.48,1:04:15.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哪里? - 别看!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where...? - Don't look!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.08,1:04:19.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里有后门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a back door.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.32,1:04:21.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走后门 他们就知道你警告我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll know you warned me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.65,1:04:25.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走前门 他就会射杀你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you go out the front, he'll put a bullet in your eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.73,1:04:38.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你有带枪吗? - 一直都有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You still packing? - Always.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.67,1:04:40.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备用枪吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get ready to use it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.58,1:04:46.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你有何计划? 对 - 他还爱着你 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's your plan? Yeah. - He's still in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.78,1:04:52.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 除非有把握 他不会开枪 - 这就是你的计划? 你还真行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He'll wait for a clear shot. - That's your plan? Thank you. Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.48,1:05:17.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拔枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Draw!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.19,1:06:09.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他上路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's on the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.73,1:06:51.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吉本斯 我最喜爱的绑匪头头 下回派辆礼车来接我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gibbons! My favorite kidnapper. Next time send a limo.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.58,1:07:00.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇咧 你别闹了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.95,1:07:05.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已打败我了 不用再折磨我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You already broke me. No need to get cruel and unusual.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.59,1:07:10.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机票? 这可好玩了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A ticket? Now, that's funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.86,1:07:13.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我现在要去哪? - 回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where am I going to go now? - Home.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.26,1:07:15.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回家?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.59,1:07:17.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的身分已被揭穿 你没用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your cover's blown. You're not useful.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.03,1:07:19.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就这样? 没我的事了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it? I'm done?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.53,1:07:23.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 我们的情报已经足够进行下一步行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No tricks. We have enough intel to move forward.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.34,1:07:28.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谁去行动? - 扫荡小组 快而有效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- With what? - Sweeper team: quick, clean, effective.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.37,1:07:31.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用担心 事情很快就会解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about it. It'll all be over soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.88,1:07:35.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你派扫荡小组去杀光所有人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean a sweeper team to come in and kill everybody?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.38,1:07:38.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们并非全都是大坏蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not all of them are as bad as you think.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.32,1:07:42.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得杀警察才能混进去 他们这还不算是坏人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had to shoot a cop. How "not as bad as I think" could they be?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.52,1:07:44.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, look.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.92,1:07:48.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事情有点复杂 里面有个女人 约娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got a complication. There's a girl. Yelena.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.83,1:07:50.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远都是有个女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's always a girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.50,1:07:54.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她想逃出来 而我派她回去帮你搜集情报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She wants out and I sent her back in to get more intel for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.70,1:07:58.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没时间玩游戏 决定已经下了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no time to play favorites. The cards have been dealt.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.94,1:08:01.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么叫决定已经下了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean the cards have been dealt?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.77,1:08:04.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你根本不认识她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't even know her, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.68,1:08:09.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 你给我们的银行帐号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, by the way, that bank number you gave us?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.78,1:08:15.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你朋友和约娜转帐大笔的现金...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your friends and Yelena have made some large cash transfers...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.65,1:08:19.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给一群俄罗斯科学家 他们专用于...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to a group of Russian scientists known to specialize and traffic...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.03,1:08:22.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生化武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in biological weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.23,1:08:26.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 老大 她跟那没关系 - 回家吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She had nothing to do with it. - Go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.30,1:08:28.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她! - 这是命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She ain't...! - That's an order.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.59,1:08:49.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情况如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.76,1:08:51.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人生真烂!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Life is shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.26,1:08:53.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 但你又能如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well what can you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.64,1:10:49.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过了这扇门 你就要效忠到底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Through this door, you are with us to the end.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.04,1:10:53.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你确定要这样? - 我确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you sure that's what you want? - I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.31,1:12:37.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是亚哈号 它就像是艘太阳能潜水艇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Ahab. Think of it as solar-powered submarine.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.22,1:12:41.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它能绕行全球 命中目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can circumnavigate the globe to reach its target.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.39,1:12:46.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它只需要在水面上搜集阳光 就能完成任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It need only surface to gather sunshine and to do its business.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.66,1:12:49.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么任务?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it? What's its business?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.79,1:12:54.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,送礼物给乖小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dropping off presents to all the good little boys and girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.44,1:13:07.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们明天就可以完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My team will be finished tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.08,1:13:09.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about you?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.12,1:13:12.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're finished now.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.75,1:13:45.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼可莱!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nikolai!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.12,1:13:48.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备火箭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring the rockets.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.99,1:13:56.98,Default,NTP,0,0,10,,(亚哈号)
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.36,1:14:28.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你设定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The detonator is for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.11,1:15:20.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毒气开始混合...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yorgi! The binary agents are mixing...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.61,1:15:22.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会害死大家!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...it will kill us all!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.89,1:15:35.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来真像小白鼠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like little white mouse.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.93,1:15:40.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜拜 小白鼠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye-bye, little mouse.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.48,1:15:59.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.51,1:17:05.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的工作已经完成 现在他们成了累赘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They did their job and now they were liability.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.55,1:17:10.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不需要太多知情的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't need anyone talking about our business.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.63,1:17:20.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,风扇会抽出毒气 让它通过水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The gas gets sucked through the extractor fans, passed into water...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.47,1:17:24.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再转化为完全无毒的空气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and broken down to become, once again, completely harmless.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.21,1:17:30.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真安静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So quiet.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.04,1:17:36.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难怪它会被称为"寂静之夜"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know now why they call it Silent Night.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.52,1:17:46.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吃点东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get some food.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.26,1:18:24.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去查是怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find out what's going on!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.46,1:18:59.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.34,1:19:07.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这招管用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That works.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.93,1:20:36.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,引爆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire in the hole.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.72,1:21:08.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么会在这里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sova. What are you doing here, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.83,1:21:12.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你先是在酒吧里陷害我 接着又开枪杀我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First you set me up in the bar. Then you shoot me in the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.46,1:21:16.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我老板这么对我 我再这么对你 这是恶性循环\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My boss does it to me. I did it to you. It's a vicious circle.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.37,1:21:18.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你觉得这很有趣? - 不 我不觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You think it's funny? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.30,1:21:20.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会是怀恨在心吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't take it personally, did you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.11,1:21:24.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我设法混进去 我们是站同一边的 记得吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did what I had to do to get in. We're on the same side.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.94,1:21:27.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我换边了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. I switched sides.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.38,1:21:32.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对我太过份了 我的政府给的也没尤里多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You pushed me too far. My government doesn't pay as well as Yorgi.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.79,1:21:36.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的政府给的是尤里给的两倍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My government pays twice as much...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.22,1:21:38.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为这样突然跳进来这行...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think you could just walk into the spy business...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.12,1:21:44.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 就能一切顺风如意? - 那你要怎样? 射杀我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...and have all the angles figured out? - What are you going to do, shoot me?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.46,1:21:46.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你希望我射哪里? 头?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where? In the head, to be quick?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.66,1:21:50.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是胸 好让我看看你的心脏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or in the chest for an open casket, so I can see your heart?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.23,1:21:52.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I think about it?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.28,1:22:01.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这是干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.78,1:22:05.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听到你讲话 知道你在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard you talking. I could tell where you were in the room.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.35,1:22:09.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么会跟伊凡在一起?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing with the Ivans?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.79,1:22:14.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.09,1:22:18.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有些话之前没对你说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something I didn't have the time to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.76,1:22:20.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是个情报员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm an agent as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.00,1:22:24.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是俄罗斯情报局的探员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm an agent for FSB, Russian Intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.60,1:22:26.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很像你们的中情局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, like your ClA.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.84,1:22:29.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我卧底两年了 - 两年?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I've been undercover for two years. - Two years?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.01,1:22:32.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的计划是什么? 等他们老死吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was your plan, let them die of old age?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.94,1:22:34.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们根本没有计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was no plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.48,1:22:39.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一年半以前 局里改组 我不再收到指令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A year ago, Intelligence gets reorganized, I stop getting orders.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.45,1:22:44.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们把我给忘了 我只能尽力求生 你懂吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They forget about me. And I did what I must to survive. You understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.29,1:22:47.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我懂个屁 我才入行一周而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do I understand? I've been an agent for a week.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.73,1:22:50.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我老板得知道一切详情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But my boss needs to know what we know now.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.86,1:22:53.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好吗? - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.73,1:22:58.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,潜艇会施放神经毒气"寂静之夜"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The submarine's purpose is to deploy a nerve agent called Silent Night.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.04,1:23:02.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它的配方在苏联解体后就失踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been missing since the Soviet Union's collapse in '91.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.44,1:23:03.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它能屠杀百万人口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can kill millions.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.94,1:23:07.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们早知他们有鬼 你查到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We knew they were up to something. You found out.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.21,1:23:11.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 干得好 XXX - 原来根本没什么扫荡小组\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's excellent work, Triple X. - There was never a sweeper team.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.95,1:23:15.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我若叫你别去跳帝国大厦...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I said don't jump off the Empire State Building....
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.12,1:23:19.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没错 我铁定会去跳 - 你看 是我激励了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're right. I'd definitely do it. - I inspired you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.66,1:23:23.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是掌权者 我理当这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm an authority figure, that's what I'm supposed to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.33,1:23:25.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 我的人已经接手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, my men are on this now.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.53,1:23:28.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你该回家了 - 那约娜呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's time for you to come home. - What about Yelena?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.30,1:23:35.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我无权给她庇护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not authorized to give her asylum.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.81,1:23:40.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我保证你回来时一定搞定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I promise it'll be done by the time you get here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.48,1:23:44.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回来吧 桑德 这是命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come home, Xander. That's an order.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.40,1:24:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尤里多快就能发射这玩意?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How soon can Yorgi launch this thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.94,1:24:11.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们叫你回去 你们的人接手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were told to go home! Your people are handling...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.44,1:24:13.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多快?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How soon, Yelena?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.85,1:24:18.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快 但这不关我们的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon. But it's not our problem anymore!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.68,1:24:21.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们若提前行动 就事关重大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they get ahead of schedule, it's everyone's.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.75,1:24:26.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能的 他有军队 碉堡 你根本没有机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got an army, a fortress. You don't stand a chance!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.26,1:24:31.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我曾为很多蠢事冒险 这是第一件对我有意义的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've risked my life for stupid reasons. This is the first one that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.26,1:24:35.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是特技表演 你会送命的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not one of your stunts. You'll die in this, you know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.20,1:24:40.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你若没回去...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't go back in there...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.41,1:24:44.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就会知道出事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he'll know something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.08,1:24:48.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能要我回去 不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't ask me to go back there. You can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.72,1:24:56.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道最讽刺的是什么吗? 我是自愿争取这任务的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to know something ironic? I volunteered for this assignment.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.92,1:25:00.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想有所贡献\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to make a difference.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.79,1:25:03.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我努力争取这任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fought for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.23,1:25:08.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就完成它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then finish it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.25,1:25:29.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得你吻我之后 我说了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember what I told you, after you kissed me?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.92,1:25:32.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没有下次? - 我说谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Never again? - I lied.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.98,1:25:54.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你仔细分析 其实我很单纯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when you break it down, I'm a simple man.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.38,1:25:56.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很高兴能跟捷克美女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd be happy with a beautiful Czech girl...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.75,1:26:00.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怪胎! 吉本斯下了新指令 上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, geek! Got new orders from Gibbons. Get in.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.79,1:26:09.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我要那些全装进这车里 - 没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I want all that in here. - Done.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.23,1:26:12.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,城堡到处装满监视器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The castle's covered with surveillance cameras.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.73,1:26:16.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们才无法靠近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why we cannot get close enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.70,1:26:24.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 所以我要去摧毁山脚下的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on. That's why I need to knock out the communications tower...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.34,1:26:26.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,联络塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...at the base of the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.05,1:26:35.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里有人会开飞机吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there anyone here who knows how to fly a plane?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.49,1:26:37.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.06,1:26:47.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些山峰附近乱流太多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too much turbulence around these mountains!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.93,1:26:50.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把我送到那个塔上方就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just get me in line with that tower!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.74,1:26:52.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剩下的交给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do the rest!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.08,1:27:07.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go now!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.17,1:28:30.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,维多 有访客来了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viktor! We got company!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.34,1:28:38.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,活逮他 再好好折磨他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Catch him fast. Kill him slow!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.84,1:32:30.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新鲜的雪花真棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing like fresh powder.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.54,1:33:11.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老相好 你是不是头昏了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yelena, my sweet dove, did you get confused?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.12,1:33:16.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的任务是...那条子杀了桑德后 再杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your assignment was to kill the cop after he killed X.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.86,1:33:22.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样不是个好俄罗斯卧底密探\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not good for undercover agent from Russian Intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.96,1:33:29.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直都知道你的底细...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew about you all along...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.07,1:33:35.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能随意摆布并利用你 真是好玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and it was my pleasure to twist you and use you how I saw fit.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.04,1:33:38.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.25,1:33:46.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在众人之中 我以为你会懂...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of all people, I thought you'd understand...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.28,1:33:48.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想达成的梦想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...what I'm trying to accomplish.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.15,1:33:51.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想像一下?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you imagine?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.82,1:33:54.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想像博拉格在毒气云团下...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine a city like Prague vanishing...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.09,1:33:58.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被消灭殆尽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in a cloud of poison gas.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.23,1:34:01.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有汉堡 伦敦 华盛顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then Hamburg, London, Washington.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.07,1:34:07.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凶手不明 原因也不明 所以大家兵戎相见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine not knowing who did it, or why. And so they turn on each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.77,1:34:11.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些人攻击那些人 那些人侵略这些人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These guys attack those guys. Those guys invade these guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.88,1:34:14.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快地 全世界闹内讧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon, whole world implodes.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.01,1:34:18.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,政府全都消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine governments disappearing.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.38,1:34:20.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in the end...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.35,1:34:24.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达成一个绝对完美的自由状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...imagine facing absolute, beautiful freedom.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.43,1:34:32.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你们都无缘亲眼目睹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But neither of you will be there to see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.77,1:34:36.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟维多一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like Viktor.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.70,1:34:41.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有柯亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like Kolya.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.02,1:35:29.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掩护我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cover me!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.16,1:35:41.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮我解开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me out of this thing!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.44,1:35:48.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他拿走硬碟 他要发射亚哈号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He took the hard drive. He's going to launch Ahab!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.75,1:35:56.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己选\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pick one.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.26,1:36:08.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊凡 轰了那些狙击手!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ivan, take out that nest!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.75,1:36:31.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要扳开保险才行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to turn the safety off.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.71,1:36:57.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽量拖住他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold them off as long as you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.64,1:37:01.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了 朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.20,1:37:59.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.55,1:38:11.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停! 他困住我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! He's got us pinned down.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.39,1:38:16.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.19,1:38:18.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有火箭筒啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a bazooka!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.96,1:38:23.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别把自己当警察 当电玩高手 随便开轰啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop thinking Prague police and start thinking PlayStation. Blow shit up!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.39,1:38:26.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是火箭筒 这是感热火箭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not bazooka. This is heat-seeker rocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.47,1:38:30.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感热?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heat-seeker?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.30,1:38:33.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,架好它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Set it.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.84,1:38:40.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那痞子在抽烟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The son of a bitch is smoking.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.13,1:38:59.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说过他会被烟害死 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told him that cigarette would kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.02,1:40:03.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学学怎么开枪吧 笨蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Learn how to shoot, piece of shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.82,1:40:31.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 帮我把他拉出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick! Help me pull him out!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.79,1:40:38.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那玩意半小时内会抵达市内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will hit the city in 30 minutes!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.64,1:40:55.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 我需要直升机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys. I need a helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.95,1:40:58.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要交通工具 我需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need transportation. I need a...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.29,1:41:08.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这 我在找你 一切搞定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}X, there you are. I gave you everything you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.09,1:41:11.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这玩意只差不会飞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This thing will damn near fly now.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.43,1:41:14.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你耍我 吉本斯根本没下令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You screwed me. Gibbons didn't authorize this.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.50,1:41:16.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会整死我们 我会完蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll hang us both out to dry.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.50,1:41:18.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 托比探员 - 什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Agent Shavers. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.67,1:41:21.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要升你的职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to give you a field promotion.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.61,1:41:25.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接手这个现场 由你全权负责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take over, finish the mop-up. You're in charge.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.74,1:41:29.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遵命 我保证达成任务 我决不会令你失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir! I'm the man for the job! I won't let you down!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.81,1:41:32.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.12,1:41:34.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,操作手册 你会需要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost forgot the manual. You'll need this.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.02,1:41:37.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老大 去拯救世界吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, X. Go kick some ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.64,1:42:02.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那玩意时速肯定有80英里 我们要怎么停下它?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That thing must be going 80 mph! How do we stop it?!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.95,1:42:06.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法 控制中心在上面的透明圆顶里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't! The controls are on the bubble panel.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.15,1:42:08.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 看到了? - 看到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You see it? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.02,1:42:11.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,硬碟就在里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The hard drive's in there!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.42,1:42:15.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有操作手册 查一查有什么可用的机关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got the manual. See if Shavers put in anything we could use.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.96,1:42:18.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他的字迹很潦草 - 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's got very bad handwriting. - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.30,1:42:24.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,火焰喷射器 迷你炸弹 车轮盖炸弹 火箭发射器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flame throwers, mini-bombs, exploding hubcaps, rocket launchers!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.17,1:42:28.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是辆坦克 你不能拿它对付亚哈号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a tank. You can't use any of it on Ahab.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.97,1:42:32.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寂静之夜要在深水中引爆才行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Silent Night only breaks down in deep water.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.48,1:42:35.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我要上去 - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll have to get on it! - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.08,1:42:38.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have to get on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.09,1:42:50.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚哈号再过22分钟就到达博拉格了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our surveillance puts Ahab 22 minutes outside of Prague.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.86,1:42:55.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们该疏散整个城市 - 22分钟疏散150万人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We should evacuate the city. - 22 minutes for 1.5 million people?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.90,1:42:59.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找空军支援 我们可能得在水面上炸了它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call air support. We may need to blow it out of the water.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.97,1:43:02.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 长官 要是我们击中它... - 那整个城市就完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- If we hit that thing... - This city will die.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.94,1:43:05.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危机必须受到控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the crisis will be contained!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.24,1:43:07.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,牺牲一个城市总胜过十个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One city's better than 10.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.58,1:43:13.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有一件事 有辆跑车跟亚哈号并行前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another thing: A blue GTO is traveling parallel to Ahab.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.69,1:43:27.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死 这条路会回到河边吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit! Does this road go back to the river?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.90,1:43:30.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 查导航地图啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Check the GPS!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.00,1:43:35.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会! 在15英里后的狄维镇!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, it does! Fifteen miles at the town of Davle!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.06,1:43:56.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里一定有我们能用的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's got to be something here we could use.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.23,1:44:00.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鱼叉炮 降落伞座椅 可弹射车顶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harpoon gun, parachutes built into seats, ejectable roof.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.43,1:44:02.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全都没用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all useless!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.07,1:44:05.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有多远?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How far are we?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.10,1:44:10.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那河就在下个村落后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The river is just beyond the next village.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.28,1:44:22.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要直接冲过去 发射火箭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going through! Use the rocket launcher!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.52,1:44:24.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 22号! - 快按\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Twenty- two! - Hit it!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.79,1:44:30.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是火焰发射器 用火箭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was a flamethrower! Use the rockets!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.46,1:44:33.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是32号 我说过了...我说过他字迹很潦草\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's 32! I told you! I told you he had bad handwriting!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.83,1:44:34.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快按\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit it!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.40,1:45:13.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托比全都装上来了 查手册 我们一定漏了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shavers loaded this thing. We're missing something.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.57,1:45:16.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后面有更多武器 你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are more weapons here on the back. Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.98,1:45:31.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你来开车! - 什么? 你疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take the wheel! - What? You're crazy!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.92,1:45:37.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刹车! 刹车!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The brake! The brake!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.23,1:45:41.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油! 加油!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The gas! The gas!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.67,1:45:56.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}X, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.01,1:45:58.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五分钟后抵达目标上空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five minutes to target.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.32,1:46:06.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说话啊 你在干嘛?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}X, talk to me! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.75,1:46:09.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你说过有个可弹射车顶 - 对 就是那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You said there was an ejectable roof. - Right here!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.92,1:46:10.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按下去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit it!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.10,1:46:27.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死 太远了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit! It's out of range!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.84,1:46:31.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那里有座桥 过桥去! - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's a bridge! Cross the bridge! - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.99,1:46:47.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.66,1:46:51.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.13,1:46:56.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 中了! - 好耶!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Got you! - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.20,1:47:01.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我真希望有带摄影机! - 你说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I wish I had a camera! - What you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.37,1:47:03.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为这次的特技肯定炫毙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is gonna be one hell of a trick.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.33,1:48:00.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三分钟后抵达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three minutes to target.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.88,1:49:54.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一分钟后抵达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One minute to target.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.08,1:49:57.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move! Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.18,1:49:59.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快让开 让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.67,1:50:19.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,望远镜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eyes!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.86,1:50:38.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十秒后抵达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten seconds to target.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.67,1:50:49.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标在望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Target in sight.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.47,1:50:53.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,取消空中行动 叫战机撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call the jets off. Tell the jets to stand down!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.25,1:51:08.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎进入桑德特区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the Xander zone!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.03,1:51:54.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,零污染 我明白 长官 零污染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zero contamination level. I understand, sir. Zero contamination level.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.91,1:52:07.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是约娜?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You Yelena?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.45,1:52:10.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吉本斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Gibbons.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.95,1:52:13.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我答应桑德要让你去美国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promised Xander you could go to America.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.32,1:52:16.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我言出必行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a man of my word.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.29,1:52:19.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在这也没什么意义了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't make much difference now, does it?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.15,1:52:48.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还活着 快过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's alive! He's alive! Come here!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.49,1:52:59.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快把他弄回来 快 快去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him out of there, double-time. Go! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.77,1:53:04.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 博拉博拉! - 什么? 我听不见!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bora Bora! - What? I can't hear you!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.21,1:53:09.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博拉 博拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bora Bora.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.63,1:53:36.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你晒伤了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're getting burnt.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.48,1:53:44.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桑德 你在吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Xander, you there?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.98,1:53:48.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你在 桑德 我能透过卫星看到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you're there, Xander. I've got you here on satellite magnification.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.22,1:53:56.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回电给我 我有要事相谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call me. We got a whole new thing to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:57.76,1:54:00.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生大事情了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something very important has come up.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.03,1:54:02.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, by the way...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:03.00,1:54:06.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已通过了吉氏测验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you passed the test. The Gibbons test.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.07,1:54:11.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别闹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta be kidding me.
